  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 413.03 Investigative Records Not Subject to Public Inspection. Information and records obtained during investigations conducted by the charitable trusts unit shall not be subject to public inspection under RSA 7:23.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
